.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH stool-secrets-backup 1  "stool-secrets-backup "
.SH NAME
stool\-secrets\-backup \- Create one password\-encrypted offline key backup outside Git workspaces
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBstool\-secrets\-backup\fR [\fB\-\-gpg\fR] [\fB\-\-ssh\fR] [\fB\-\-all\fR] [\fB\-\-input\fR] [\fB\-\-output\fR] [\fB\-\-passphrase\-file\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Create one password\-encrypted offline key backup outside Git workspaces
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-gpg\fR
Only GPG keys
.TP
\fB\-\-ssh\fR
Only SSH keys
.TP
\fB\-\-all\fR
All available key categories (the default)
.TP
\fB\-\-input\fR \fI<INPUT>\fR
Source user directory (defaults to the current user environment)
.TP
\fB\-\-output\fR \fI<OUTPUT>\fR
New backup file (defaults to stool\-keys\-<timestamp>.tar.age in the current directory)
.TP
\fB\-\-passphrase\-file\fR \fI<PASSPHRASE_FILE>\fR
Read the password from a private external file or inherited pipe
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
